WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.293
Tab 1: LeetCode.

00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:02.706
Tab 37: I don't even know

00:00:02.706 --> 00:00:03.750
anymore.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.453
Every tab knows one thing about

00:00:05.453 --> 00:00:06.640
