00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:07.803
each other.

00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:12.139
Placiq pulls DSA, projects, resume and

00:00:12.139 --> 00:00:14.464
GitHub into one connected workflow.

00:00:15.619 --> 00:00:16.419
Close the tabs.

00:00:16.268 --> 00:00:17.668
Keep the progress.
